WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.463
Just had a brow lamination? Here's how to keep your brows looking great for six weeks!

2
00:00:05.463 --> 00:00:11.950
Just remember: keep them dry, brush them into shape, condition them, and avoid a few things.

3
00:00:11.950 --> 00:00:18.577
For the first 24 hours, keep your brows dry: no washing, no sweating and no brow make-up.

4
00:00:18.577 --> 00:00:22.784
The shape is still setting, and water too soon will flatten it.

5
00:00:22.784 --> 00:00:27.093
Every morning, brush your brow hairs up into shape with a clean brush.

6
00:00:27.093 --> 00:00:31.878
In a few seconds your brows look neat, with no gel or pencil needed.

7
00:00:31.878 --> 00:00:35.606
Every night, apply a little brow oil or brow serum.

8
00:00:35.606 --> 00:00:41.257
The lamination solution dries the hairs, and conditioning keeps them soft and shiny.

9
00:00:41.257 --> 00:00:47.222
In the first week, avoid the sauna, swimming, scrubs and retinol on the brow area.

10
00:00:47.222 --> 00:00:52.790
Redo your lamination after six to eight weeks, not sooner, so the hairs can rest.

11
00:00:52.790 --> 00:01:01.364
In short: keep them dry for 24 hours, brush every morning, condition every night, and avoid heat and retinol in the first week.

12
00:01:01.364 --> 00:01:04.798
